@AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7143

### List all customers
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
Accept: application/json

### Search customers by name (first, last, or "First Last")
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/search?q=Orlando
Accept: application/json

### Get one customer
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a customer
POST {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Customer",
  "emailAddress": "test.customer@example.com"
}

### Orders for a customer (29485 has orders; most customers have none)
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/29485/orders
Accept: application/json

### Order summary for a customer
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/29485/order-summary
Accept: application/json

### Rewards tier for a customer (customer 3 has one; customer 1 returns 200 with null tier fields)
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/3/rewards
Accept: application/json

### Addresses for a customer (29503 has two; a customer with none returns 200 [])
GET {{AHC.Sandbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customers/29503/addresses
Accept: application/json
